cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this artifact, please cite the accompanying paper."
type: software
title: "A two-coordinate obstruction for affine interpretations of the Yolcu–Aaronson–Heule Collatz system"
authors:
  - family-names: Valbuena
    given-names: Lucas
repository-code: "https://github.com/x1xhlol/collatz-two-coordinate-obstruction"
url: "https://github.com/x1xhlol/collatz-two-coordinate-obstruction"
abstract: >-
  Lean proofs and a paper showing that nonnegative real affine interpretations
  in two coordinates, with first diagonal entry at least one for every symbol,
  have zero first-coordinate offset gap for every rule whenever all eleven
  rules of the Yolcu–Aaronson–Heule Collatz system are weakly oriented
  coefficientwise. The result holds separately for the original system and
  its word reversal.
keywords:
  - Collatz conjecture
  - string rewriting
  - matrix interpretations
  - Lean
  - formal verification
